t","text":"The document is checked for conformance the schema cannot express and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parser does not enforce — referential integrity, durations declared before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any divisions, ending pairing, part-group balance, and standard instrument"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sounds. Only checks that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are sound on conforming input are performed; see "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLValidator\/Issue"},{"type":"text","text":" for the ones"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deliberately omitted. The checks run against the part-wise score; a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"time-wise score (which the normalizer converts to part-wise, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"canonical pipeline never presents one here) is projected to part-wise"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before checking."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An opus passes straight through, marked validated with no issues: its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"schema is four elements and the parser already enforces nearly everything"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"they constrain, so there is nothing left for the checker to decide."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Throws","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLValidator\/Error\/notNormalized","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" if ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDocument\/isNormalized","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Call","type":"text"},{"text":" ","ty